# Unilayer Smart Contract Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Unilayer.

Unilayer is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a DeFi smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Unilayer  
Audit type: DeFi smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

## Public Audit Report

[02_Smart Contract Audit_Unilayer.pdf](./02_Smart%20Contract%20Audit_Unilayer.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed DeFi smart contract security work.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s smart contract audit work connected to DeFi application logic, token infrastructure and protocol security.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
